<title>FRANCE: Rouen Dec 1-4 wheat exports at 123,696 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Dec 1-4 wheat exports at 123,696 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat exports from Rouen reached 123,696 tonnes between December 1 and December 4, port officials said.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 381,000 tonnes in the whole of December 1995.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes)</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		     22,800</p>
<p>    Britain			    4,800</p>
<p>    Italy			     70,800</p>
<p>    Morocco			   22,000</p>
<p>    Poland			     3,296</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
